Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:17.55,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}2人が離れ離れにならないように
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.89,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&666666&}神様叶えてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.52,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}Yes My Love
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:28.93,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}终于 彼此牵着手
